      "created_at": "2023-11-07T09:32:14.541Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I’ve run a few sessions of Love And Justice, the magical girl version. We had good fun with it - not that deep mechanically, but you get a few good people together to tell a story, you don’t always need that much crunch.</p>",
